OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACourt of Appeal judges deliver ruling
OL,4,Aon Henry Nowak killer's sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FVickrum Digwa stabbed 18-year-old
OL,7,Fstudent Henry Nowak to death in
OL,8,FSouthampton in December 2025
OL,10,FHe was found guilty of murder and
OL,11,Fjailed for life with a minimum term of
OL,12,F21 years
OL,14,FThe case gained international attention
OL,15,Fafter it emerged Digwa falsely claimed
OL,16,Fhe was the victim of a racist attack,
OL,17,Fleading to Nowak being handcuffed as he
OL,18,Flay dying
OL,20,FDigwa is seeking permission to
OL,21,Fchallenge the length of his sentence at
OL,22,Fthe Court of Appeal
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,306,300,200,140,0,100
