OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ACourt of Appeal judges deliver ruling
OL,4,Aon Henry Nowak killer's sentence
OL,5,
OL,6,FJonathan Polnay KC, for the Attorney
OL,7,FGeneral, argued Digwa's 21-year minimum
OL,8,Fterm was too lenient, citing his use of
OL,9,Fa large dagger, abusing the religious
OL,10,Fexemption to carry it, and his conduct
OL,11,Fas Henry Nowak lay dying
OL,13,FImran Khan KC, for Digwa, argued his
OL,14,F21-year minimum term was too long,
OL,15,Fsaying the judge counted overlapping
OL,16,Faggravating factors more than once
OL,18,FJudgment is expected at 15:30 GMT
OL,23,APub: 05-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
